solution:
**Given:**

Avi alone can do a piece of work in = 60 days

Prakash alone can do a piece of work = 80 days

**Formula used:**

Work = Efficiency × Time

**Calculation:**

Let they both together can complete the work in X days.

The one-day work of Avi = {1over60}

The one-day work of Prakash = {1over80}

The one-day work of together = {1over X}

⇒ {1over X}={1over60}+{1over80}

⇒ {1over X}={4+3over240}

⇒ {1over X}={7over240}

⇒ X={240over7}

**∴ The required result will be {240over7}.**
